WEBVTT

00:01.080 --> 00:06.600
Return to the capital and properly meet our Great Xuan's first female official.

00:11.960 --> 00:13.360
You smiled.

00:16.560 --> 00:20.400
All these years I've rarely seen you truly smile.

00:25.320 --> 00:26.720
Your Majesty.

00:38.520 --> 00:41.853
To be able to treat Your Majesty as an equal.

00:42.520 --> 00:43.920
And grow old together.

00:44.880 --> 00:46.280
Is Wan'er's fortune.

